==Trivia==
Marill is one of four Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion featured in the "Carnivine of the Pastoria Great Marsh" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]] as {{p|Marill}} can be found in the [[Great Marsh]] in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}; this is also the setting for this card's standard illustration, as the marsh's train can be seen in the background.

===Origin===
*{{m|Water Gun}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Marill}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

